tions:\n  /jayzk-slides:\n    title: Jayzk Slides\n    kind: root\n    order: 0\n    raw: |-\n      # Jayzk Slides\n\n      This documentation define a set of slides that give an outline of what Jazyk is.\n\n      The Slides themselves are defined under [Slides](./slides.md).\n\n      The look of the slides are defined in [Slide template](template.md).\n    hash: 398d1b604384dade\n    lines:\n    - 0\n    - 7\ncoverage:\n  /jayzk-slides:\n    state: covered\n    claimedBy: g2\n","jazyk-out/docs/docs/slide-about.md.yaml":"contentHash: 0af27d283bcdbbd8\nsections:\n  /slide-about:\n    title: Slide about\n    kind: root\n    order: 0\n    raw: |-\n      # Slide about\n\n      This slide defines what Jazyk is about in a couple of sentences.\n    hash: 4339746b34f8bf3c\n    lines:\n    - 0\n    - 3\ncoverage:\n  /slide-about:\n    state: covered\n    claimedBy: g6\n","jazyk-out/docs/docs/slide-intro.md.yaml":"contentHash: 526034e92b8de01d\nsections:\n  /slide-intro:\n    title: Slide intro\n    kind: root\n    order: 0\n    raw: |-\n      # Slide intro\n\n      This slide shows a headline title `Jazyk` as well as a link to the [site](https://jazyk.org).\n    hash: 4921b80d2fb10a06\n    lines:\n    - 0\n    - 3\ncoverage:\n  /slide-intro:\n    state: covered\n    claimedBy: g7\n","jazyk-out/docs/docs/slides.md.yaml":"contentHash: 0475f88eff85b317\nsections:\n  /slides:\n    title: Slides\n    kind: root\n    order: 0\n    raw: |-\n      # Slides\n\n      The slides are composed of the following slides:\n      1. [Introduction](./slide-intro.md)\n      2. [About](./slide-about.md)\n    hash: 28dfecc9d1241b75\n    lines:\n    - 0\n    - 5\ncoverage:\n  /slides:\n    state: covered\n    claimedBy: g3\n","jazyk-out/docs/docs/template.md.yaml":"contentHash: 2e61b22dbc21a40c\nsections:\n  /template:\n    title: Template\n    kind: root\n    order: 0\n    raw: |\n      # Template\n\n      This defines how all of the [slides](./slides.md) are structured and need to follow the conventions.\n    hash: 06ccc35f34579a0e\n    lines:\n    - 0\n    - 4\n  /template/format:\n    title: Format\n    kind: heading\n    order: 0\n    parent: /template\n    raw: |\n      ## Format\n\n      All slides are under the Microsoft PowerePoint file format.\n    hash: 2241ae408768b1f5\n    lines:\n    - 4\n    - 8\n  /template/look:\n    title: Look\n    kind: heading\n    order: 1\n    parent: /template\n    raw: |\n      ## Look\n    hash: 3254b5c9a9fafa8a\n    lines:\n    - 8\n    - 10\n  /template/look/color-palette:\n    title: Color palette\n    kind: heading\n    order: 1\n    parent: /template/look\n    raw: |\n      ### Color palette\n\n      The primary color is #248555 with a complementary color #8e4367.\n    hash: 3725b5c61edbe46f\n    lines:\n    - 16\n    - 20\n  /template/look/font:\n    title: Font\n    kind: heading\n    order: 2\n    parent: /template/look\n    raw: |-\n      ### Font\n\n      Use `Comic Sans MS` throughout.\n    hash: 8c62f5afbb617dc5\n    lines:\n    - 20\n    - 23\n  /template/look/footer:\n    title: Footer\n    kind: heading\n    order: 0\n    parent: /template/look\n    raw: |\n      ### Footer\n\n      All slides have a footer:\n      - Bottom left has the [site](https://jazyk.org) with a copyright.\n      Bottom right has the author Matus Faro.\n    hash: 6271e67752dec5ab\n    lines:\n    - 10\n    - 16\ncoverage:\n  /template:\n    state: non-normative\n    note: 'Introductory navigation: the sentence links to slides.md and states the template''s purpose; the concrete conventions are defined in the child sections Format and Look, not here.'\n    claimedBy: g4\n  /template/format:\n    state: covered\n    claimedBy: g4\n  /template/look:\n    state: non-normative\n    note: Heading-only section with no body text; the look requirements are stated in its child sections Color palette, Font, and Footer.\n    claimedBy: g4\n  /template/look/color-palette:\n    state: covered\n    claimedBy: g5\n  /template/look/font:\n    state: covered\n    claimedBy: g5\n  /template/look/footer:\n    state: covered\n    claimedBy: g5\n","jazyk-out/docsgen/about.md":"# About\n\n`ent:about` · «slide» · [card](./entities/about.md)\n\nThe About slide, one of the slides the Slides deck is composed of.\n\nParent: [Slides](./slides.md)\n\nLevel: [Slides](./levels/slides.md)\n\n## Requirements\n\n**docs/slide-about.md § Slide about**\n\n### `req:slide-about-1`\n\nThe About slide defines what Jazyk is about in a couple of sentences.\n\n> This slide defines what Jazyk is about in a couple of sentences.\n\nSource: `docs/slide-about.md#/slide-about`\n\n**docs/slides.md § Slides**\n\n### `req:slides-2`\n\nThe Slides deck is composed of the About slide.\n\nEdges: `ent:slides` → `ent:about` (composition)\n\n> 2. [About](../../docs/slide-about.md)\n\nSource: `docs/slides.md#/slides` · ties: [Slides](./slides.md)\n\n## Relationships\n\n- [Slides](./slides.md) → About (composition) · `rel:about~slides` · from req:slides-2\n\n## Mentioned in\n\n- `docs/slides.md#/slides`: \"2. [About](../../docs/slide-about.md)\"\n- `docs/slide-about.md#/slide-about`: \"This slide defines what Jazyk is about in a couple of sentences.\"\n","jazyk-out/docsgen/diagrams/class/public.md":"# Public\n\n`view:class/public` · class · 4 members\n\n## Level\n\na curated view; it belongs to no level\n\n![Public](../../../diagrams/class/public.svg)\n\n`view:class/public` (class, 4 members): [About](../../entities/about.md), [Footer](../../entities/footer.md), [Introduction](../../entities/introduction.md), [Slides](../../entities/slides.md) · [source](../../../diagrams/class/public.puml)\n\n## Drawn\n\n- [About](../../entities/about.md) · «slide»\n- [Footer](../../entities/footer.md)\n- [Introduction](../../entities/introduction.md) · «slide»\n- [Slides](../../entities/slides.md) · «slides» · [level below](./slides.md)\n\n## Around\n\n- Below: [view:class/slides](./slides.md) `view:class/slides`\n\n","jazyk-out/docsgen/diagrams/component/slides.md"