 req:template-2\n\n## Mentioned in\n\n- `docs/template.md#/template/look/footer`: \"All slides have a footer:\"\n- `docs/template.md#/template/look/footer`: \"- Bottom left has the [site](https://jazyk.org) with a copyright.\"\n- `docs/template.md#/template/look/footer`: \"Bottom right has the author Matus Faro.\"\n","jazyk-out/docsgen/fragmentation.md":"# Fragmentation\n\nEntities whose mentions span several documents, most spread first.\n\n- [Slides](./entities/slides.md): 3 documents, 6 sections: docs/README.md, docs/slides.md, docs/template.md\n- [About](./entities/about.md): 2 documents, 2 sections: docs/slide-about.md, docs/slides.md\n- [Introduction](./entities/introduction.md): 2 documents, 2 sections: docs/slide-intro.md, docs/slides.md\n","jazyk-out/docsgen/glossary.md":"# Glossary\n\n- **About** «slide»: The About slide, one of the slides the Slides deck is composed of. · [card](./entities/about.md) · sections: [docs/slide-about.md#/slide-about](../../docs/slide-about.md#slide-about), [docs/slides.md#/slides](../../docs/slides.md#slides)\n- **Footer**: The footer that all slides have, with a bottom-left and a bottom-right area. · [card](./entities/footer.md) · sections: [docs/template.md#/template/look/footer](../../docs/template.md#footer)\n- **Introduction** «slide»: The Introduction slide, one of the slides the Slides deck is composed of. · [card](./entities/introduction.md) · sections: [docs/slide-intro.md#/slide-intro](../../docs/slide-intro.md#slide-intro), [docs/slides.md#/slides](../../docs/slides.md#slides)\n- **Slides** «slides»: The set of slides that give an outline of what Jazyk is. · [card](./entities/slides.md) · sections: [docs/README.md#/jayzk-slides](../../docs/README.md#jayzk-slides), [docs/slides.md#/slides](../../docs/slides.md#slides), [docs/template.md#/template/format](../../docs/template.md#format), [docs/template.md#/template/look/color-palette](../../docs/template.md#color-palette), [docs/template.md#/template/look/font](../../docs/template.md#font), [docs/template.md#/template/look/footer](../../docs/template.md#footer)\n","jazyk-out/docsgen/index.md":"# Index\n\nStart here: the top level of `public`, then [Slides](./entities/slides.md) (3 children)\n\n- [About](./about.md) `ent:about`\n- [Footer](./footer.md) `ent:footer`\n- [Introduction](./introduction.md) `ent:introduction`\n- [Slides](./slides.md) `ent:slides`\n\n## Diagrams\n\n![Public](../diagrams/class/public.svg)\n\n`view:class/public` (class, 4 members): [About](./entities/about.md), [Footer](./entities/footer.md), [Introduction](./entities/introduction.md), [Slides](./entities/slides.md) · [source](../diagrams/class/public.puml) · [page](./diagrams/class/public.md)\n\n![Slides](../diagrams/component/slides.svg)\n\n`view:component/slides` (component, 3 members): [About](./entities/about.md), [Footer](./entities/footer.md), [Introduction](./entities/introduction.md) · [source](../diagrams/component/slides.puml) · [page](./diagrams/component/slides.md)\n\n## Views\n\n- `view:class/public` (class) Public · 4 members · [svg](../diagrams/class/public.svg) · [puml](../diagrams/class/public.puml)\n- `view:component/slides` (component) Slides · 3 members · [svg](../diagrams/component/slides.svg) · [puml](../diagrams/component/slides.puml)\n\nReports: [glossary](./glossary.md) · [fragmentation](./fragmentation.md) · [staleness](./staleness.md)\n\n","jazyk-out/docsgen/introduction.md":"# Introduction\n\n`ent:introduction` · «slide» · [card](./entities/introduction.md)\n\nThe Introduction slide, one of the slides the Slides deck is composed of.\n\nParent: [Slides](./slides.md)\n\nLevel: [Slides](./levels/slides.md)\n\n## Requirements\n\n**docs/slide-intro.md § Slide intro**\n\n### `req:slide-intro-1`\n\nThe Introduction slide shows a headline title `Jazyk`.\n\n> This slide shows a headline title `Jazyk` as well as a link to the [site](https://jazyk.org).\n\nSource: `docs/slide-intro.md#/slide-intro`\n\n### `req:slide-intro-2`\n\nThe Introduction slide shows a link to the site (https://jazyk.org).\n\n> This slide shows a headline title `Jazyk` as well as a link to the [site](https://jazyk.org).\n\nSource: `docs/slide-intro.md#/slide-intro`\n\n**docs/slides.md § Slides**\n\n### `req:slides-1`\n\nThe Slides deck is composed of the Introduction slide.\n\nEdges: `ent:slides` → `ent:introduction` (composition)\n\n> 1. [Introduction](../../docs/slide-intro.md)\n\nSource: `docs/slides.md#/slides` · ties: [Slides](./slides.md)\n\n## Relationships\n\n- [Slides](./slides.md) → Introduction (composition) · `rel:introduction~slides` · from req:slides-1\n\n## Mentioned in\n\n- `docs/slides.md#/slides`: \"1. [Introduction](../../docs/slide-intro.md)\"\n- `docs/slide-intro.md#/slide-intro`: \"This slide shows a headline title `Jazyk` as well as a link to the [site](https://jazyk.org).\"\n","jazyk-out/docsgen/levels/slides.md":"`scope:public` › Slides\n\n# Slides\n\n`ent:slides` · «slides» · The set of slides that give an outline of what Jazyk is. · [card](../entities/slides.md) · [entity page](../slides.md)\n\n## Members\n\n- [About](../entities/about.md) · «slide» · The About slide, one of the slides the Slides deck is composed of.\n- [Introduction](../entities/introduction.md) · «slide» · The Introduction slide, one of the slides the Slides deck is composed of.\n- [Footer](../entities/footer.md) · The footer that all slides have, with a bottom-left and a bottom-right area.\n\n","jazyk-out/docsgen/slides.md":"# Slides\n\n`ent:slides` · «slides» · [card](./entities/slides.md)\n\nThe set of slides that give an outline of what Jazyk is.\n\nChildren: [About](./about.md), [Footer](./footer.md), [Introduction](./introduction.md)\n\nOwn level: [Slides](./levels/slides.md)\n\n## Requirements\n\n- [docs/README.md § Jayzk Slides](#reqreadme-1): 1 statement\n- [docs/slides.md § Slides](#reqslides-1): 2 statements\n- [docs/template.md § Format](#reqtemplate-1): 1 statement\n- [docs/template.md § Color palette](#reqtemplate-5): 1 statement\n- [docs/template.md § Font](#reqtemplate-6): 1 statement\n- [docs/template.md § Footer](#reqtemplate-2): 1 statement\n\n**docs/README.md § Jayzk Slides**\n\n### `req:readme-1`\n\nThe slides give an outline of what Jazyk is.\n\nFacets: behavior\n\n> This documentation define a set of slides that give an outline of what Jazyk is.\n\nSource: `docs/README.md#/jayzk-slides`\n\n**docs/slides.md § Slides**\n\n### `req:slides-1`\n\nThe Slides deck is composed of the Introduction slide.\n\nEdges: `ent:slides` → `ent:introduction` (composition)\n\n> 1. [Introduction](../../docs/slide-intro.md)\n\nSource: `docs/slides.md#/slides` · ties: [Introduction](./introduction.md)\n\n### `req:slides-2`\n\nThe Slides deck is composed of the About slide.\n\nEdges: `ent:slides` → `ent:about` (composition)\n\n> 2. [About](../../docs/slide-about.md)\n\nSource: `docs/slides.md#/slides` · ties: [About](./about.md)\n\n**docs/template.md § Format**\n\n### `req:template-1`\n\nAll slides use the Microsoft PowerPoint file format.\n\nFacets: constraint\n\n> All slides are under the Microsoft PowerePoint file format.\n\nSource: `docs/template.md#/template/format`\n\n**docs/template.md § Color palette**\n\n### `req:template-5`\n\nThe slides use #248555 as the primary color and #8e4367 as the complementary color.\n\nFacets: constraint\n\n> The primary color is #248555 with a complementary color #8e4367.\n\nSource: `docs/template.md#/template/look/color-palette`\n\n**docs/template.md § Font**\n\n### `req:template-6`\n\nThe slides use Comic Sans MS throughout.\n\nFacets: constraint\n\n> Use `Comic Sans MS` throughout.\n\nSource: `docs/template.md#/template/look/font`\n\n**docs/template.md § Footer**\n\n### `req:template-2`\n\nAll slides have a footer.\n\nFacets: constraint\n\nEdges: `ent:slides` → `ent:footer` (composition, 1)\n\nSource: `docs/template.md#/template/look/footer` · ties: [Footer](./footer.md)\n\n## Relationships\n\n- Slides → [About](./about.md) (composition) · `rel:about~slides` · from req:slides-2\n- Slides → [Footer](./footer.md) (composition, 1) · `rel:footer~slides` · from req:template-2\n- Slides → [Introduction](./introduction.md) (composition) · `rel:introduction~slides` · from req:slides-1\n\n## Mentioned in\n\n- `docs/README.md#/jayzk-slides`: \"This documentation define a set of slides that give an outline of what Jazyk is.\"\n- `docs/slides.md#/slides`: \"1. [Introduction](../../docs/slide-intro.md)\"\n- `docs/slides.md#/slides`: \"2. [About](../../docs/slide-about.md)\"\n- `docs/template.md#/template/format`: \"All slides are under the Microsoft PowerePoint file format.\"\n- `docs/template.md#/template/look/footer`: \"All slides have a footer:\"\n- `docs/template.md#/template/look/color-palette`: \"The primary color is #248555 with a complementary color #8e4367.\"\n- `docs/template.md#/template/look/font`: \"Use `Comic Sans MS` throughout.\"\n","jazyk-out/docsgen/staleness.md":"# Staleness\n\nOpen diagnostics by the section their subjects anchor in, most burdened first.\n\nNo open diagnostic anchors in a section.\n","jazyk-out/graph/diagnostics.yaml":"{}\n","jazyk-out/graph/entities.yaml":"ent:about:\n  name: About\n  definition: The About slide, one of the slides the Slides deck is composed of.\n  stereotype: slide\n  parent: ent:slides\n  mentions:\n  - doc: docs/slides.md\n    section: /slides\n    quote: 2. [About](./slide-about.md)\n  - doc: docs/slide-about.md\n    section: /slide-about\n    quote: This slide defines what Jazyk is about in a couple of sentences.\n  created: g3\n  updated: g6\nent:footer:\n  name: Footer\n  definition: The footer that all slides have, with a bottom-left and a bottom-right area.\n  parent: ent:slides\n  mentions:\n  - doc: docs/template.md\n    section: /template/look/footer\n    quote: 'All slides have a footer:'\n  - doc: docs/template.md\n    section: /template/look/footer\n    quote: '- Bottom left has the [site](https://jazyk.org) with a copyright.'\n  - doc: docs/template.md\n    